F0=C('**F0 conclusion.** MIFlu has the lowest observed MSE (1.5574), but MSE alone does not establish public-health utility. The top-three spread is 20.2% relative to MIFlu, not less than 20%.','**F0 结论。** MIFlu 的观测 MSE 最低（1.5574），但仅靠 MSE 不能证明公共卫生效用。前三名相对 MIFlu 的跨度为 20.2%，并非小于 20%。')
F1=C('**F1 conclusion.** NLinear and MIFlu each pass 4/16 aggregated cells, while PatchTST passes 0/16. NLinear has lower mean PIE (9.477% versus MIFlu 26.846%) but higher mean PTE (1.677 versus 1.128 weeks). This is a timing–magnitude trade-off, not dominance. The ordering is inverted at both ends among the three leaders: MSE orders MIFlu, PatchTST, NLinear; PIE orders NLinear, MIFlu, PatchTST.','**F1 结论。** NLinear 与 MIFlu 各通过 4/16 个聚合单元，PatchTST 为 0/16。NLinear 的平均 PIE 更低（9.477%，MIFlu 为 26.846%），但平均 PTE 更高（1.677 周，MIFlu 为 1.128 周）。这是时间与幅度的取舍，不是全面优越。前三模型的排序在两端倒置：MSE 顺序为 MIFlu、PatchTST、NLinear，PIE 顺序为 NLinear、MIFlu、PatchTST。')
F2=C('**F2 conclusion.** The fitted slope is +0.1171 and R² is 0.0223 across the 11 arms with exported parameter counts. Size alone explains little of their observed MSE variation. This subset result does not prove that capacity is irrelevant.','**F2 结论。** 在导出参数量的 11 个模型中，拟合斜率为 +0.1171，R² 为 0.0223。规模单独解释的观测 MSE 变化很少。该子集结果不能证明容量无关紧要。')
F3=C('**F3 conclusion.** Proper Holm gives 0/136 rejections (128/136 before adjustment), with a minimum adjusted p of about 0.0664 and NLinear–PatchTST p ≈ 0.1172. PatchTST still has 11.2% lower observed MSE with 211× the parameters and lower MSE in 10/12 cells. Non-rejection does not establish equivalence or show that the gain is noise.','**F3 结论。** 正确 Holm 校正为 0/136 个拒绝（校正前 128/136），最小校正 p 约 0.0664，NLinear–PatchTST 的 p ≈ 0.1172。PatchTST 的观测 MSE 仍低 11.2%，参数多 211 倍，并在 10/12 单元中误差更低。未拒绝不能证明等价，也不能断言增益是噪声。')
F4=C('**F4 conclusion.** The 11 tested frozen encoders score 4.7374–5.2049, or 3.04–3.34× MIFlu’s MSE. All exceed the decision tree’s 4.3198 and pass 0/16 cells. This is a negative result for this feature/readout configuration; prompting, fine-tuning and numerical foundation models remain untested.','**F4 结论。** 所测 11 个冻结编码器的 MSE 为 4.7374–5.2049，是 MIFlu 的 3.04–3.34 倍，全部高于决策树的 4.3198，且均通过 0/16 单元。这是该特征与读出配置的负面结果；提示、微调及数值时序基础模型仍未检验。')
F5=C('**F5 provisional conclusion.** In miflu_model.py’s author_faithful path, text follows time tokens behind causal attention and the head reads the time tokens. Static inspection therefore predicts no text influence during deterministic evaluation. The supplied tests_archive/test_miflu_ablations.py explicitly asserts both text invariance and full/no-text equality with matched CPU initialisation. It was inspected statically, not executed here. Other fusion paths and training randomness require separate checks.','**F5 暂定结论。** miflu_model.py 的 author_faithful 路径将文本置于时间词元之后，使用因果注意力，预测头只读取时间词元。静态检查因此推断确定性评估时文本不影响输出。所附 tests_archive/test_miflu_ablations.py 明确断言文本不变性，以及匹配 CPU 初始化时完整与无文本模型相同。本次仅静态检查，未执行。其他融合路径及训练随机性须分别验证。')
METRICS=C('Peak timing error (PTE) is the absolute difference between predicted and observed peak weeks. Peak intensity error (PIE) is the absolute peak-height error divided by the observed peak, expressed as a percentage. Kramer–Shaman [2] verifies the separate one-week and 25% tolerances. We apply both to mean errors in each (model, L, step) cell. This joint screen and its peak detector are project choices, not a clinical acceptance standard. A mean-error pass is not an individual-season success probability.','峰值时间误差 PTE 是预测与观测峰值周的绝对差。峰值强度误差 PIE 为峰高绝对差除以观测峰高后乘百分比。Kramer–Shaman [2] 可核实分别为一周与 25% 的容差。项目把两者联合应用于（模型、L、step）单元的平均误差；该联合筛选及峰检测属于项目选择，不是临床接受标准。平均误差达标不等于逐季成功概率。')
PROTOCOL=C('We use a chronological split and train-only scaling. Validation selects checkpoints in this implementation. The handoff attributes test-set checkpoint selection and a one-variable loader to upstream code, but a pinned author checkout is absent and the public endpoint could not be opened. Those upstream allegations remain unverified. The notes also show learning-rate differences between code defaults and paper settings, so the comparison must not be described as differing in only two ways.','本项目采用时序划分、仅训练段拟合标准化，并用验证集选择检查点。交接资料将测试集选检查点及单变量加载问题归于上游代码，但未提供固定版本作者仓库，公开端点也未能打开，因此上游指控仍未核实。笔记还列出代码默认学习率与原文设置的差异，不能称为仅有两处偏离。')
REPRO=C('The reproduction CSV reports mean MSE 1.4995 versus 1.4355, a 4.5% increase. MSE is lower at L24 and L36 and higher at L48 and L60. Mean MAE is 0.8043 versus 0.7452 (+7.9%), but its signs are one lower and three higher; MAE does not share the MSE 2–2 crossover. Protocol and missing upstream provenance limit claims of exact replication.','复现 CSV 的平均 MSE 为 1.4995，对照 1.4355，增加 4.5%。L24、L36 更低，L48、L60 更高。平均 MAE 为 0.8043，对照 0.7452（+7.9%），但逐跨度为一低三高；MAE 没有 MSE 的二比二符号交叉。协议差异与上游来源缺失限制了精确复现的主张。')
STATS=C('The source table contains 136 pairs from 17 models. The other 11 models are absent, so this is not an all-pairs analysis of 28 models. Holm uses a forward cumulative maximum after sorting raw p-values. The source uses a reverse cumulative minimum. At n=12, the two-sided exact floor 2/4096 multiplied by 136 exceeds 0.05, so this family cannot yield a rejection under proper Holm adjustment. Overlapping targets and repeated horizons also make the cells dependent. Raw p-values and unadjusted bootstrap intervals remain exploratory.','源表有 17 个模型的 136 对，另外 11 个模型不在其中，因此并非 28 模型的全配对分析。Holm 在原始 p 值排序后取前向累计最大值；源代码却取反向累计最小值。n=12 时双侧精确检验下限 2/4096 乘 136 已超过 0.05，因此正确 Holm 校正下该检验族不可能拒绝任何原假设。重复目标及跨度也使单元相关。原始 p 值及未校正 bootstrap 区间只作探索性参考。')
LIT=C('Patching and linear baselines are established [3–5]. Time-LLM, CALF and TimeCMA use different alignment/adaptation designs [6–8]. Chronos, TimesFM, Moirai and Lag-Llama pretrain on numerical series and were not evaluated here [9–12]. Earlier LLM-removal work already questions the benefit of language pretraining [13], while a 2026 preprint reports conditional benefits under cross-dataset shifts [14]. The contribution here is the specific influenza protocol audit and multi-metric comparison.','分块与线性基线已有研究 [3–5]。Time-LLM、CALF 与 TimeCMA 的对齐及适配设计不同 [6–8]。Chronos、TimesFM、Moirai、Lag-Llama 在数值序列上预训练，本次未评测 [9–12]。较早的 LLM 移除研究已质疑语言预训练收益 [13]，而 2026 年预印本报告跨数据集偏移下的条件性收益 [14]。本项目贡献在于特定流感任务的协议审计与多指标比较。')
THREATS=C('One national series and one chronological split do not establish regional or prospective utility. Peak matching can use future observations to define events and is a retrospective evaluation tool. Synthetic date labels require a verified CDC calendar mapping before season-specific claims. Parameter exports omit MIFlu and encoders. The 27/60 ablation status is owner-reported, not a live cluster check. Modern numerical foundation baselines, regional results, rolling origins and validated uncertainty are missing.','单一全国序列与单次时序划分不能证明区域或前瞻效用。峰值匹配可使用未来观测定义事件，只能作为回顾性评测工具。合成日期标签必须与 CDC 日历核实映射后才能作逐季判断。参数导出缺少 MIFlu 与编码器。27/60 的消融状态来自用户报告，而非实时集群检查。现代数值基础模型、区域结果、滚动原点及经过验证的不确定性仍缺失。')
DECISION=C('Decision rule for future validation: specify an MSE budget B, an allowable peak-failure rate q, and decision costs before inspecting a new test period. Among models meeting B and q on validation seasons, minimise expected decision cost, then parameter count as a tie-breaker. For an escalate/wait decision, use costs c_FP for unnecessary escalation and c_FN for a missed surge, with zero cost for correct actions. Escalate when a validated surge probability exceeds c_FP/(c_FP+c_FN). Costs, B and q have not been elicited or validated, so no model is certified for deployment. NLinear is a low-cost candidate for further peak-height validation; MIFlu remains the observed MSE leader.','后续验证的决策规则：在查看新测试期之前确定 MSE 预算 B、允许峰值失败率 q 与决策代价。在验证季同时满足 B 与 q 的模型中最小化期望决策代价，再以参数量打破平局。对升级响应 / 等待决策，误报代价为 c_FP，漏报代价为 c_FN，正确行动代价为零；仅当经过验证的高峰概率超过 c_FP/(c_FP+c_FN) 时升级。代价、B、q 尚未征询或验证，因此没有模型被认证可部署。NLinear 是低成本峰高验证候选，MIFlu 仍为观测 MSE 最优。')
REPRODUCIBILITY=C('Run python scripts/verify_snapshot.py --raw-smoke and python -m pytest tests/test_snapshot_audit.py -q from the repository root. The audit re-derives headline aggregates, peak flags, correlations, regression, Holm adjustment and one raw prediction MSE. Seven newly added CPU audit tests passed; they are separate from the archived model suite. The corrected ZIP supplies tests_archive/. Collection fails under the historical layout and missing model dependencies. No archived-suite pass count or reliable collected total is claimed. Training, live HPC status and upstream code were not rerun. The original source CSVs are retained unchanged, with a separate corrected Holm export.','在仓库根目录运行 python scripts/verify_snapshot.py --raw-smoke 及 python -m pytest tests/test_snapshot_audit.py -q。审计重算主要聚合值、峰值标记、相关系数、回归、Holm 校正和一个原始预测 MSE。七个新增 CPU 审计测试已通过，它们与归档模型测试分开。修正 ZIP 已提供 tests_archive/，但历史目录布局及模型依赖缺失导致收集失败。本次不主张归档测试通过数或可靠总数。本次未重跑训练、未查询实时 HPC，亦未运行上游代码。原 CSV 保持不变，Holm 修正另行导出。')
def use(x):return ('p',x)
ZH_TITLES=['基于大语言模型的多模态流感预测方案','针对温带及热带六十四国的流感预测开发与验证','一个时间序列相当于六十四个词的长期预测方法','Transformer 是否适用于时间序列预测','反转维度的 Transformer 时间序列预测','通过重编程大语言模型进行时间序列预测','通过跨模态微调对齐语言模型与时间序列','通过跨模态对齐增强多变量时间序列预测','学习时间序列语言的 Chronos 方法','仅解码器时间序列预测基础模型','通用时间序列预测 Transformer 的统一训练','面向概率时间序列预测基础模型的 Lag Llama','语言模型真的有助于时间序列预测吗','重新思考大语言模型在时间序列预测中的作用','动态时间序列的共形预测区间','时间序列的顺序预测共形推断','分布偏移下的自适应共形推断','以区间格式评估传染病预测']
def refline(s,lang):
 if lang=='en':return f"[{s['id']}] {s['authors']}, “{s['title']},” {s['venue']}, {s['year']}. {s['url']}"
 author=s['authors'].split(',')[0].split(' and ')[0]+' 等'
 return f"[{s['id']}] {author}，{(ZH_TITLES[s['id']-1] if s['id']<=len(ZH_TITLES) else s['title'])}（{'中文译名' if s['id']<=len(ZH_TITLES) else '英文原题'}），{s['year']}。{s['url']}"
def references(all_sources=False):
 return ('refs', {lang:[refline(q,lang) for q in SOURCES if all_sources or q['id']<=18] for lang in ['en','zh']})

def internal_base():
 return [h(1,'1 Data and provenance','1 数据与来源'),use(REPRODUCIBILITY),tb('data'),h(1,'2 Methodology and literature','2 方法与文献'),use(LIT),tb('protocols'),use(PROTOCOL),use(METRICS),h(1,'3 Reproduction of MIFlu','3 MIFlu 复现'),use(REPRO),tb('reproduction'),para('**Reproduction conclusion.** The observed MSE gap is +4.5% under disclosed implementation differences. This does not establish superiority over the paper.','**复现结论。** 在已披露实现差异下，观测 MSE 差为 +4.5%，不能据此主张优于原文。'),tb('oracle'),fig('fig_forecast_miflu_L24.png'),fig('fig_forecast_miflu_L60.png'),h(1,'4 Benchmark accuracy','4 基准精度'),tb('benchmark'),use(F0),para('The roster is 13 conventional models, MIFlu plus three other LLM-based implementations, and 11 frozen encoders. These sum to 28. All 28 have lower mean MSE than the seasonal-naive export (6.2132). No claim about hyperparameter tuning being less important is supported.','正式名单为 13 个传统模型、MIFlu 加另外三个基于 LLM 的实现，以及 11 个冻结编码器，总计 28。28 个模型平均 MSE 均低于季节朴素导出的 6.2132。现有证据不能判断超参数调优是否较不重要。'),fig('fig_forecast_patchtst_L24.png'),fig('fig_forecast_nlinear_L24.png'),h(1,'5 Peak timing and magnitude','5 峰值时间与幅度'),use(METRICS),tb('peak_summary'),tb('grid'),use(F1),fig('fig_pte_pie_heatmap.png'),para('The positive MSE–PIE rank correlation (+0.736) means lower MSE generally accompanies lower PIE. The negative MSE–pass-count correlation (−0.429) also has the expected direction: lower error tends to accompany more passes. Neither statistic proves decoupling. NLinear’s third-place MSE but first-place PIE provides a local mismatch between objectives.','MSE 与 PIE 正秩相关（+0.736）意味着 MSE 较低时 PIE 通常也较低。MSE 与通过数负相关（−0.429）方向同样符合预期：误差较低通常伴随更多通过。两者都不能证明脱钩。NLinear 的 MSE 第三、PIE 第一，说明局部目标排序不一致。'),h(1,'6 Accuracy and parameter count','6 精度与参数量'),tb('efficiency'),use(F2),fig('fig_pareto_frontier.png'),h(1,'7 Statistical audit','7 统计审计'),use(STATS),tb('paired'),use(F3),h(1,'8 Frozen language encoders','8 冻结语言编码器'),tb('encoders'),use(F4),para('Distribution mismatch, frozen capacity and the chosen readout are possible explanations. Their causal roles are not separated by these results. A linear readout does not guarantee that useful nonlinear features can be recovered.','分布差异、冻结容量和所选读出均可能影响结果，但本结果未分离其因果作用。线性读出不能保证提取可用的非线性特征。'),h(1,'9 Ablation design and status','9 消融设计与状态'),tb('ablation'),use(F5),h(1,'10 Interpretation and publication plan','10 解释与发表计划'),use(THREATS),use(DECISION),para('Recommendation O1: retain the evaluation contribution and repair its evidence base before adding a new mechanism. The current draft is oriented towards IEEE JBHI because its subject is health forecasting, but it is not submission-ready. Rolling origins, regional validation, stronger baselines and independent code provenance matter more than another architecture before the school deadline.','建议 O1：保留实证评估贡献，先补齐证据，再考虑新增机制。当前草稿面向 IEEE JBHI 的健康预测主题，但尚未达到投稿状态。在学校截止日前，滚动原点、区域验证、更强基线与独立代码来源比再加一个架构更重要。'),h(1,'11 Reproducibility and open checks','11 可复现性与待核实项'),use(REPRODUCIBILITY),para('Hardware provenance covers 204 rows, including the excluded DLinear and omitting MIFlu and all frozen encoders. It overlaps 192 retained cells. Complete per-cell hardware coverage is therefore not established. The original reproduce_all.py targets historical paths and is not the audited quickstart.','硬件来源表共 204 行，其中包括被排除的 DLinear，但没有 MIFlu 与冻结编码器；与正式名单重叠的是 192 单元。因此不能证明逐单元硬件来源已齐。原 reproduce_all.py 面向历史路径，并非此次核实的快速入口。'),para('Unverified items: pinned upstream checkpoint/loader protocol and learning rate; archived suite execution and no-text runtime test; ten-seed raw reproduction logs; model revisions/licences; live ablation and regional status; real CDC calendar mapping; current JBHI author limits/JCR record and next-cycle venue dates. Each requires its primary artefact, not a further prose assertion.','待核实项：固定上游版本的检查点、加载器与学习率；归档测试执行与 no-text 运行测试；十种子原始复现日志；模型版本与许可；实时消融及区域状态；真实 CDC 日历映射；当前 JBHI 作者限制、JCR 记录及下一轮会议日期。每项都需原始证据，不能靠文字断言补足。'),h(1,'12 References','12 参考文献'),references()]

def internal():
 from internal_qa import qa_blocks
 blocks=internal_base(); result=[]; section=0
 result.append(para('**Reading purpose.** This internal report supports supervision and explanation. Questions Q01–Q25 are placed beside the relevant evidence. Each answer connects named papers and reading locations to local evidence, explains the choice and gives a supervisor short answer. Accuracy and peak skill cover 28 arms; parameter exports cover 11, and paired tests 17.','**阅读目的。** 本内部报告用于导师交流及理解过程。Q01–Q25 放在相关证据旁：每题连接具名论文、阅读位置与本地证据，解释选择理由，并给出导师简答。精度与峰值覆盖 28 个模型，参数导出覆盖 11 个，配对检验覆盖 17 个。'))
 for kind,payload in blocks:
  if kind=='h1':section=int(payload['en'].split()[0])
  if kind=='refs':payload=references(all_sources=True)[1]
  result.append((kind,payload))
  ids=[]
  if kind=='table':
   ids={'data':[1,2,3],'protocols':[4,5],'oracle':[9],'benchmark':[10,11],
        'grid':[12,13],'efficiency':[15,16,17],'paired':[18,19,20],
        'encoders':[21],'ablation':[]}.get(payload,[])
  elif kind=='p':
   if section==2 and payload==METRICS:ids=[6]
   elif section==3 and payload['en'].startswith('**Reproduction conclusion.**'):ids=[7,8]
   elif section==5 and payload['en'].startswith('The positive MSE'):ids=[14]
   elif section==9 and payload==F5:ids=[22,23]
   elif section==10 and payload['en'].startswith('Recommendation O1:'):ids=[24]
   elif section==11 and payload['en'].startswith('Unverified items:'):ids=[25]
  result.extend(qa_blocks(ids))
 return result

def progress():
 return [h(2,'1. Project objectives','1. 项目目标'),para('**Problem statement.** An accurate national influenza curve can still have timing or peak-height errors. I am independently reproducing MIFlu and evaluating how model choice changes when peak errors and parameter count accompany average error. The project evaluates accuracy, peak skill, parameter efficiency and statistical evidence, with explicitly different model subsets.','**问题陈述。** 全国流感预测曲线即使平均误差较低，仍可能出现峰值时间或高度错误。本项目独立复现 MIFlu，并检验同时考虑峰值误差与参数量后模型选择如何变化。项目从精度、峰值技巧、参数效率和统计证据四个维度评估，并明确各维度覆盖的模型子集。'),para('**Objectives.** (1) Reproduce and explain Table V. (2) Compare 28 retained implementations under common windows. (3) assess peak timing, magnitude and parameter trade-offs. (4) Test the specific frozen-encoder transfer setup. (5) Validate findings across origins and regions before claiming deployment value.','**目标。** （1）复现并解释表 V。（2）在统一窗口下比较 28 个保留实现。（3）评估峰值时间、幅度与参数取舍。（4）测试特定冻结编码器迁移设置。（5）在声称部署价值前，以多个原点及区域验证结论。'),h(2,'2. Original project planning chart','2. 原始项目规划图'),tb('planning'),h(2,'3. Background study','3. 背景研究'),use(LIT),para('**Global and societal context.** Peak forecasts can inform preparedness and capacity planning, but retrospective national accuracy does not measure clinical benefit. Transparent evaluation can reduce unjustified spending on complex models and expose failure modes. No real-world resource-saving or patient-outcome effect was measured [2,18].','**全球与社会背景。** 峰值预测可能帮助准备及容量规划，但全国回顾性精度不能衡量临床收益。透明评估有助于减少对复杂模型的不当投入，并揭示失败方式。本项目未测量真实资源节省或患者结局效应 [2,18]。'),h(2,'4. Methodology','4. 方法'),tb('protocols'),use(PROTOCOL),use(METRICS),para('**Design impact.** All retained arms use the same cropped evaluation windows. Scaling is fitted on training data. The 7-variable average is dimensionless, while peak errors use ILITOTAL in patient counts. This allows transparent comparisons without pretending the joint screen certifies safe public-health use. Three benchmark seeds reflect compute limits; additional independent seasons are needed for uncertainty.','**设计影响。** 所有保留模型采用相同裁剪窗口，标准化仅在训练数据拟合。七变量均值无量纲，峰值误差则使用患者人数尺度的 ILITOTAL。这样能够透明比较，同时不把联合筛选误称为公共卫生安全认证。基准的三个种子反映算力限制，不确定性仍需更多独立季节。'),page(),h(2,'6. Progress','6. 进度'),para('**Progress against plan.** The supplied exports contain the reproduction table and 28 × 4 × 3 benchmark cell means. The original suite is supplied under tests_archive/, but cannot be collected cleanly here. My audit now recomputes the CSV aggregates and has seven new CPU tests. The ablation remains owner-reported at 27/60 with no per-variant aggregation. Regional and rolling-origin evaluation are incomplete.','**对照计划的进度。** 所附导出包含复现表和 28 × 4 × 3 基准单元聚合。原测试已包含在 tests_archive/，但本环境无法完整收集。本次审计重算 CSV 聚合，并新增七个 CPU 测试。消融仍为用户报告的 27/60，未逐变体聚合。区域与滚动原点评测尚未完成。'),tb('reproduction'),use(REPRO),para('**Reproduction conclusion.** The observed mean-MSE gap is +4.5%. The remaining protocol and provenance differences prevent a claim of exact replication or superiority.','**复现结论。** 观测平均 MSE 差为 +4.5%。尚存协议与来源差异，不能声称精确复现或优于原文。'),page(),tb('benchmark'),use(F0),tb('grid'),use(F1),fig('fig_ks_ranking.png'),tb('efficiency'),use(F2),tb('paired'),use(F3),fig('fig_pareto_frontier.png'),tb('encoders'),use(F4),tb('ablation'),use(F5),para('**Problems encountered.** The source exported Holm column remains defective; the corrected corpus recomputes the proper adjustment. The roster arithmetic, MAE crossover, hardware coverage and missing tests also needed correction. Queue status cannot be certified from this offline snapshot. I will freeze the corrected reporting path and keep all original CSVs for comparison.','**遇到的问题。** 源 CSV 导出的 Holm 列仍有误；修正语料已重新计算正确校正。模型名单算术、MAE 交叉、硬件覆盖与测试缺失也需修正。离线快照不能认证实时排队状态。我将冻结修正后的报告路径，并保留所有原 CSV 便于对照。'),h(2,'7. Summary of objectives addressed and results achieved to date','7. 已处理目标与迄今成果总结'),tb('objectives'),h(2,'8. Work schedule and expected results for the next one to two months','8. 未来一至两月安排及预期成果'),tb('schedule'),para('**Risks and mitigation.** Queue delays may prevent ablation completion, so retain explicit incomplete labels. Validate the date mapping and use season-level rolling origins to address temporal dependence. Restore the original tests and pin dependencies before publication. Confirm a presentation appointment with both supervisor and assessor. The school template requires both presentation and timely InfoNet submission.','**风险与应对。** 排队可能妨碍消融完成，因此须保留明确未完成标签。验证日期映射并采用逐季滚动原点，以处理时间相关。发表前恢复原测试并固定依赖版本。与导师及评阅人确认汇报预约。学校模板要求完成汇报，并按时经 InfoNet 提交。'),para('Date ____________________    Signature of student ____________________','日期 ____________________    学生签名 ____________________'),para('Key references used in the background and methodology are listed below. Numbering matches the internal report and manuscript.','背景与方法使用的关键文献列于下方，编号与内部报告及手稿一致。'),('refs',{l:[refline(s,l) for s in SOURCES if s['id'] in [1,2,9,13,14,18]] for l in ['en','zh']})]

def manuscript():
 abstract=('We audit an independent MIFlu reproduction and 28 forecasting implementations on a 966-row US national influenza series. The supplied reproduction table gives mean squared error (MSE) 1.4995 versus the published 1.4355, with lower MSE at two horizons and higher MSE at two. Under three benchmark seeds, MIFlu, PatchTST and NLinear achieve 1.5574, 1.6621 and 1.8716. A joint screen using literature-derived timing and intensity tolerances yields 4/16 passing aggregated cells for both NLinear and MIFlu and 0/16 for PatchTST. NLinear has lower mean peak-intensity error but higher mean timing error than MIFlu. Across 11 arms with parameter exports, the MSE–log-parameter fit has slope +0.1171 and R² 0.0223. An audit identifies an incorrect Holm routine in the supplied analysis: correcting 136 comparisons among 17 models yields no rejections, with NLinear–PatchTST p approximately 0.1172. This does not establish equivalence. Eleven frozen language encoders perform worse than a decision tree in the tested readout configuration. Ablation completion is owner-reported at 27/60 and is not aggregated. The findings are descriptive and limited to one split, retrospective peak detection and adapted implementations. We recommend reporting peak magnitude and timing alongside average error, then selecting on validation-defined costs and budgets before prospective deployment.')
 assert len(abstract.split())<=250
 az='本文审计 MIFlu 的独立复现及美国全国流感 966 行序列上的 28 个预测实现。复现表平均 MSE 为 1.4995，原文为 1.4355，逐跨度两低两高。三种子基准中，MIFlu、PatchTST、NLinear 分别为 1.5574、1.6621、1.8716。采用文献容差的联合筛选下，NLinear 与 MIFlu 各通过 4/16 聚合单元，PatchTST 为 0/16。NLinear 峰高误差更低，但时间误差高于 MIFlu。11 个有参数导出的模型中，MSE 对对数参数的斜率为 +0.1171，R² 为 0.0223。源 Holm 程序存在错误；修正 17 模型的 136 配对后，没有拒绝，NLinear–PatchTST 的 p 约 0.1172，不能据此证明等价。11 个冻结语言编码器在所测读出配置中均差于决策树。消融仅有用户报告的 27/60 完成，尚未聚合。结论受单次划分、回顾性峰检测及适配实现限制。建议并列报告峰高、时间与平均误差，并在前瞻部署前依验证阶段确定的代价与预算选模。'
 b=[h(1,'Auditing MIFlu and Comparing Influenza Forecasts Across Accuracy Peak Error and Parameter Count','MIFlu 审计及流感预测精度峰值误差与参数量比较'),para('CHAN Sing Yeung\nFinal Year Project, Department of Electrical Engineering, City University of Hong Kong','CHAN Sing Yeung\n香港城市大学电子工程学系毕业设计'),para('Single-column review draft oriented towards IEEE JBHI. Current submission rules and page limits remain unverified. This is an evaluation contribution and is not yet submission-ready.','面向 IEEE JBHI 的单栏审阅草稿。当前投稿规则与页数限制仍待核实。贡献定位为实证评估，尚未达到投稿状态。'),h(2,'Abstract','摘要'),para(abstract,az),h(1,'I. Introduction','I. 引言'),para('Influenza forecasting supports preparedness, but lower average error does not ensure accurate peak magnitude or timing. We examine a supplied MIFlu reproduction [1] and a broader set of project implementations without treating the joint peak screen as clinical certification.','流感预测可支持准备工作，但较低平均误差不能保证峰高与时间准确。本文检查所附 MIFlu 复现 [1] 与更广的项目实现，并不把联合峰值筛选当作临床认证。'),para('**Contributions.** (1) An audited reproduction comparison with a +4.5% mean-MSE gap. (2) A shared-window ranking of 28 implementations. (3) A peak timing–magnitude comparison revealing 4/16, 4/16 and 0/16 aggregate-cell passes for the leading three arms. (4) A parameter and statistical audit identifying low explained variance (R² 0.0223) and a defective Holm adjustment. The prescriptive addition is a validation-defined decision rule, not a tested new forecasting method.','**贡献。** （1）审计平均 MSE 差为 +4.5% 的复现比较。（2）统一窗口下的 28 实现排名。（3）比较峰值时间与幅度，前三模型聚合单元通过数为 4/16、4/16、0/16。（4）参数及统计审计揭示较低解释度（R² 0.0223）与错误 Holm 校正。新增指导是验证阶段确定的决策规则，并非已测试的新预测方法。'),h(1,'II. Related Work','II. 相关研究'),use(LIT),para('Time-series conformal methods [15–17] motivate future interval evaluation but do not automatically validate intervals for peaks selected retrospectively. WIS [18] evaluates distributions or intervals, while PIE measures point-forecast peak height. These quantities must be separated.','时序共形方法 [15–17] 可启发后续区间评测，但不能自动保证回顾性选峰的区间有效。WIS [18] 评价分布或区间，PIE 则衡量点预测峰高，二者必须区分。'),h(1,'III. Data','III. 数据'),para('The two supplied author-format and paper-exact files each contain 966 rows and seven matched numerical channels, with numeric maximum absolute difference zero. The original downloaded upstream file and its commit are absent. The chronological split is 676/97/193, with train-only scaling and test targets starting no earlier than row 773. Dates in the author-format file are synthetic.','所附作者格式与 paper-exact 文件均含 966 行及七个对应数值通道，最大绝对数值差为零。原始独立下载文件与固定提交版本未提供。时序划分为 676/97/193，标准化仅拟合训练段，测试目标最早始于第 773 行。作者格式日期为合成标签。'),h(1,'IV. Method','IV. 方法'),h(2,'A. Evaluation protocols','A. 评测协议'),use(PROTOCOL),para('Reproduction uses seeds 2021–2030. The benchmark uses seeds 42/43/44 and 160/144/144/128 windows at L24/36/48/60. Cropping reproduces the local drop_last rule; a full-window sensitivity analysis is still required. The two MIFlu estimates answer different questions.','复现使用种子 2021–2030。基准使用 42/43/44，L24/36/48/60 对应 160/144/144/128 窗口。裁剪沿用本地 drop_last 规则，仍需完整窗口敏感性分析。两个 MIFlu 估计回答不同问题。'),h(2,'B. Metrics','B. 指标'),use(METRICS),h(2,'C. Statistical analysis','C. 统计分析'),use(STATS),h(2,'D. Decision rule','D. 决策规则'),use(DECISION),h(1,'V. Experiments','V. 实验'),para('The roster comprises 13 conventional models, MIFlu and three other LLM-based implementations, and 11 frozen language encoders. Accuracy uses seven-variable standardised MSE/MAE. Peak errors use de-normalised ILITOTAL. Parameter analysis has 11 models, paired tests 17, and frozen-feature analysis 11; these denominators must not be conflated. We do not present these adapted implementations as verified exact replications of each cited comparator.','模型名单包括 13 个传统模型、MIFlu 及另外三个基于 LLM 的实现、11 个冻结语言编码器。精度采用七变量标准化 MSE/MAE，峰值误差采用反标准化 ILITOTAL。参数分析为 11 模型，配对检验为 17，冻结特征分析为 11，分母不能混用。本文不将适配实现视为已核实的各参考方法精确复现。'),h(1,'VI. Results','VI. 结果'),h(2,'A. Reproduction','A. 复现'),use(REPRO),tb('reproduction'),h(2,'B. Benchmark accuracy','B. 基准精度'),tb('benchmark'),use(F0),h(2,'C. Peak timing and magnitude','C. 峰值时间与幅度'),tb('peak_summary'),tb('grid'),use(F1),para('MSE correlates with PIE (ρ=+0.736, p<0.0001) and inversely with passes (ρ=−0.429, p=0.023). Both signs are consistent with generally better error accompanying better peak results. These associations coexist with NLinear’s lower PIE despite its third-place MSE. They do not imply independence or a complete rank reversal.','MSE 与 PIE 正相关（ρ=+0.736，p<0.0001），与通过数负相关（ρ=−0.429，p=0.023）。两种符号均符合整体误差较低伴随较好峰值结果的趋势；同时 NLinear 虽 MSE 第三，PIE 却更低。该现象不能证明独立或排序完全反转。'),h(2,'D. Parameters','D. 参数'),tb('efficiency'),use(F2),h(2,'E. Statistical correction','E. 统计修正'),tb('paired'),use(F3),h(2,'F. Frozen language encoders','F. 冻结语言编码器'),tb('encoders'),use(F4),h(2,'G. Ablation design','G. 消融设计'),tb('ablation'),use(F5),h(1,'VII. Threats to Validity','VII. 有效性威胁'),use(THREATS),para('Source p-values are retained but their complete raw paired inputs were not independently rescored. Corrected Holm values recover the enumeration grid and retain provenance to the rounded export. The reported source effect uses pooled model SD rather than paired-difference SD. A seed ensemble with an arbitrary variance floor is not a validated predictive distribution. No prospective utility, equivalence margin or calibrated surge probability has been established.','保留了源 p 值，但未从全部原始配对输入独立重评分。修正 Holm 值恢复枚举网格，并保留与四舍五入导出的来源关系。源效应量采用模型合并标准差，而非配对差标准差。带任意方差下限的种子集成不是已验证的预测分布。前瞻效用、等价界值及经校准的高峰概率均未确立。'),h(1,'VIII. Conclusion','VIII. 结论'),para('MIFlu leads the observed MSE ranking. NLinear offers lower peak-height error at low parameter count but has worse mean peak timing than MIFlu. The joint screen therefore exposes trade-offs rather than a universal winner. Corrected significance analysis supports no familywise rejection at the present resolution. Further regional, rolling-origin and foundation-model controls are needed before submission or deployment.','MIFlu 在观测 MSE 排名中领先。NLinear 参数较少、峰高误差较低，但平均峰值时间差于 MIFlu。联合筛选揭示的是取舍，而非通用赢家。正确显著性分析在当前分辨率下没有检验族拒绝。投稿或部署前仍需区域、滚动原点与基础模型对照。'),h(1,'IX. References','IX. 参考文献'),references(),page(),h(1,'Appendix A Forecast panels','附录 A 预测曲线'),para('Illustrative panels from the supplied snapshot. The x-axis is the file’s test-week index, not independently verified CDC epidemiological dates. These figures do not establish causality or prospective performance.','以下为所附快照的示例曲线。横轴为文件中的测试周下标，未独立核实为 CDC 流行病学日期。图形不能证明因果或前瞻表现。'),fig('fig_forecast_miflu_L24.png'),fig('fig_forecast_patchtst_L24.png'),fig('fig_forecast_nlinear_L24.png')]
 return b

def final_styles(d):
 from docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH
 if d.doc.paragraphs:d.doc.paragraphs[0].style='Title'
 for key in ['Title','Title Char']:
  if key in d.doc.styles:
   st=d.doc.styles[key];st.font.color.rgb=RGBColor(0,0,0);st.font.underline=False
   for border in list(st.element.iter(qn('w:pBdr'))):border.getparent().remove(border)
 for para in d.doc.paragraphs:
  if para.text.startswith('CHAN Sing Yeung'):para.alignment=WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER
 for i,p in enumerate(d.doc.paragraphs):
  if p.text.startswith(('Evidence.','证据。')) and i:
   d.doc.paragraphs[i-1].paragraph_format.keep_with_next=True
   for run in p.runs:run.font.size=Pt(9.2)
 for p in d.doc.paragraphs:
  if p.style.name.startswith('Heading') or p.style.name=='Title':
   for run in p.runs:run.font.color.rgb=RGBColor(0,0,0)
 for s in d.doc.sections:
  for p in s.header.paragraphs:
   for run in p.runs:run.font.color.rgb=RGBColor(0,0,0)
 # Keep native requested CJK font names. Actual substitutions are reported by rendering QA.
 for t in d.doc.tables:
  for row in t.rows:
   for cell in row.cells:
    tcPr=cell._tc.get_or_add_tcPr();borders=tcPr.find(qn('w:tcBorders'))
    if borders is None:
     from docx.oxml import OxmlElement
     borders=OxmlElement('w:tcBorders');tcPr.append(borders)
    for edge in ['top','bottom','left','right']:
     from docx.oxml import OxmlElement
     el=OxmlElement('w:'+edge);el.set(qn('w:val'),'single');el.set(qn('w:sz'),'4');el.set(qn('w:color'),'D9D9D9');borders.append(el)

def build():
 for lang in ['en','zh']:
  for kind,blocks in [('report_internal',internal()),('progress_report',progress()),('ieee_manuscript',manuscript())]:
   if '--internal-only' in sys.argv and kind!='report_internal':continue
   d=Doc(lang,font_size=11.5 if kind=='progress_report' else (10.5 if kind=='report_internal' else 10.0),margin_cm=2.0 if kind!='ieee_manuscript' else 1.7,table_roman=kind=='ieee_manuscript',footer_left='MIFlu audit 3 November 2026')
   if kind=='report_internal':
    d.title(C('MIFlu reproduction and influenza forecasting audit','MIFlu 复现与流感预测审计')[lang],sub=C('Internal technical report with explanatory questions and answers','含解释性问答的内部技术报告')[lang]);d.kv([(C('Author','作者')[lang],'CHAN Sing Yeung'),(C('Snapshot','快照')[lang],'3 November 2026'),(C('Reading guide','阅读说明')[lang],C('Four evaluation axes with Q01–Q25 for supervisor discussion','四个评价维度，附 Q01–Q25 导师交流问答')[lang])]);d.h(2,C('Contents','目录')[lang]);d.plain_list([x[1][lang] for x in blocks if x[0]=='h1']);d.page_break()
   if kind=='progress_report':
    d.title('CITY UNIVERSITY OF HONG KONG',sub=C('Department of Electrical Engineering   Progress Report   2026/27 Semester A','电子工程学系   进度报告   2026/27 学年 A 学期')[lang]);d.h(1,'PART A');d.kv([(C('Name of Student','学生姓名')[lang],'CHAN Sing Yeung'),(C('Student ID','学生编号')[lang],'____________________'),(C('Programme Major','课程主修')[lang],'____________________'),(C('Project Code and Title','项目编号与题目')[lang],C('________ MIFlu reproduction and influenza forecasting audit','________ MIFlu 复现与流感预测审计')[lang]),(C('Name of Supervisor','导师姓名')[lang],'Prof. Katie CHAN'),(C('Name of Assessor','评阅人姓名')[lang],'____________________'),(C('Meetings with supervisor and assessor','与导师及评阅人会面次数')[lang],'______ / ______'),(C('Average weekly project hours','每周平均项目时数')[lang],'______ hours/week')]);d.h(1,'PART B')
   render(d,blocks)
   if kind=='report_internal':
    for t in d.doc.tables:
     if len(t.rows)==29:
      paragraphs=[p for row in t.rows for c in row.cells for p in c.paragraphs]
      for p in paragraphs[:-1]:p.paragraph_format.keep_with_next=True
   final_styles(d);path=OUT/f'{kind}_{lang}.docx';d.doc.core_properties.author='CHAN Sing Yeung';d.save(str(path));print(path.name,len(d.doc.tables),'tables')
 if '--tables-json' in sys.argv:
  def clean(x):
   if isinstance(x,dict):return {k:clean(v) for k,v in x.items()}
   if isinstance(x,list):return [clean(v) for v in x]
   return str(x) if isinstance(x,Path) else x
  (ROOT/'audit/REVISED_TABLES.json').write_text(json.dumps({k:clean(v()) for k,v in TABLES.items()},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))
if __name__=='__main__':build()
